    {
      "body": "I've encountered empty bucket encountered on ranks 1–7 while saving a `dp_reshardable` optimizer checkpoint in an upstream mHC4 run with BF16 model weights, FP32 mHC parameters, and DP=8.\r\n\r\nThe same run also exposed the independent mixed-dtype parameter-index issue addressed by [#7804](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7804). \r\n\r\nThese are independent issues, but the mHC configuration appears to require both fixes to complete checkpoint save/resume. I'm linking those two PRs for reference.\r\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-05T20:51:32Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/6191#issuecomment-6002689255",
      "id": 6002689255,
